   * row-major layout. Here we compute all means in a single
   * row-major pass:
   *   - For each row i, traverse all columns j contiguously.
   *   - For each column j, the accumulation order over i is
   *     still increasing i = 0..nPB-1, so per-column floating-
   *     point summation order is preserved.
   * ---------------------------------------------------------- */

