   * Step 3: Covariance matrix computation
   *
   * Original algorithm (upper triangle):
   *
   *   for (i = 0; i < _PB_M; i++)
   *     for (j = i; j < _PB_M; j++) {
   *       cov[i][j] = 0;
   *       for (k = 0; k < _PB_N; k++)
   *         cov[i][j] += data[k][i] * data[k][j];
   *       cov[i][j] /= (float_n - 1);
   *       cov[j][i] = cov[i][j];
   *     }
   *
